Lately I've been playing Valkyrie, a little more than my usual monk or 
tourist, in the hope of ascending an irrevocably chaotic and male 
valkyrie.

One thing I've noticed is that it can be exceedingly boring and 
repetitive despite the fact that valkyries are among the simpler classes 
available in NetHack.

So I'd like to make some suggestions regarding the Valkyrie class.

1. Have the valkyries start out with spears or warhammers rather than a 
long sword. Pretty much guaranteed +1 Excalibur for lawful valks makes 
the game much, much easier to the point of tedium. When I did a Google 
image search for valkyries most of the pictures featured them bearing 
spears more than long swords. Also SWORDS EVERYWHERE in NetHack.

2. Have valkyries acquire cold resistance at XL7. From what I've seen I 
usually come across frosty monsters after level five and might as well 
let people sweat it a bit rather than suffering a few frozen potions. 
Speed intrinsic moves up to XL11.

3. Spruce up the quest a bit so Surtur isn't second-wimpiest after Vlad.

All these would apply to vanilla. Already know about Enhanced Artifacts 
and other patches.


